% n24_num_conv_unequal -- THE discriminator for p21. `pf : P 7` claimed at
% `P 8`. If numerals compared by anything but their value (by node id, by
% tag alone, by 'both are numerals'), this would be ACCEPTED and the kernel
% would prove 7 = 8. Rejected: conversion fails (kernel 26).
0 sort 0
axiom I64 : 0
numtype I64
1 const I64
2 sort 0
3 pi 1 2
axiom P : 3
4 const P
5 num 7
6 app 4 5
axiom pf : 6
7 const pf
8 const P
9 num 8
10 app 8 9
check 7 : 10
